# Build context is the repo root (for `docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile .`).
# Keep the image lean and never ship local or secret material.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
# Nitro writes apps/app/.output. A host build must never be copied in, or the image ships a
# bundle that was configured for somebody else's domain.
**/.output
**/.tanstack
**/.nitro
.git
**/.git
.github
.context
deploy
tests
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.mjs
**/__tests__
# Only the guides at the root: the template library under packages/ holds .md files that ship.
*.md
*.log
*.pid
.env
.env.*
